S-SKILLS

NAME: Socar!
SIN: wrath
COIN-POWER: +6
BASE-POWER: 8
DMG_TYPE: blunt 
cost: mp: 1

INFO
{
(on_use) Se o alvo tiver 5+ @Bleed, Final Power +1
}

COIN
{
(heads_hit) Aplique 3 @Bleed
(on_hit) Aplique 3 @Bleed
}

COIN
{
(on_hit) Aplique +3 @Bleed @Count
(on_hit) Ative @Bleed no alvo 1x, então reduza o @Bleed @Count em 2
}

END
{
(skill_end) Ganhe 3 @Burn
}

